Package: rdfamily
Type: Package
Title: Regression Discontinuity Family for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/rdfamily
BugReports: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/rdfamily/issues
Description: Regression discontinuity analyses for jamovi built on the rdrobust,
    rddensity and rdlocrand packages: sharp, fuzzy and kink designs with robust
    bias-corrected inference (Calonico, Cattaneo and Titiunik, 2014), manipulation
    (density) tests (Cattaneo, Jansson and Ma, 2020), covariate balance and placebo
    outcomes, robustness checks (placebo cutoffs, bandwidths, donut holes,
    polynomial orders) and local randomization inference (Cattaneo, Frandsen and
    Titiunik, 2015).
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 2.3.4),
    R6,
    ggplot2,
    rdrobust,
    rddensity,
    rdlocrand,
    rdmulti,
    RDHonest,
    rdhte,
    rdpower
